he venue you are planning to have your wedding at looks absolutely incredible!!!! You are going to have such an amazing time.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you have any questions in terms of wedding photography or scheduling your wedding day please let us know and we&#039;d be happy to help and lend our experience &amp;lt;3&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914999,"PostDate":1469275037,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hola @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287366\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287366-latashaingram\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Latashaingram<\/span><\/a> and welcome to the amazing bestdestinationwedding.com community. \u00a0The venue you are planning to have your wedding at looks absolutely incredible!!!! You are going to have such an amazing time.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you have any questions in terms of wedding photography or scheduling your wedding day please let us know and we'd be happy to help and lend our experience <3<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914999]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-287055-0-19358600-1469289166.jpg\" title=\"Jannet_Evan_Teaser_06.jpg - Size: 175.38KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-287055-0-19358600-1469289166.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Jannet_Evan_Teaser_06.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914999]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-287055-0-26386200-1469289184.jpg\" title=\"Kayla_Jason_Teaser_15.jpg - Size: 106.44KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-287055-0-26386200-1469289184.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Kayla_Jason_Teaser_15.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914999]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-287055-0-91922500-1469289193.jpg\" title=\"Jessica_Brennan_Teaser_14.jpg - Size: 532.45KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-287055-0-91922500-1469289193.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Jessica_Brennan_Teaser_14.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/05\/jasminandmattidomexicosignature.png\" alt=\"jasminandmattidomexicosignature.png\"><\/p>\n<p><strong>Website:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/'>http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Email:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:info@jasminandmatt.com'>info@jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Phone:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\">+52 984-114-3386<\/span><br><strong>Facebook:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/'>Jasmin & Matt Photography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Instagram:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/jasminandmattphotography\/'>@jasminandmattphotography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Pinterest:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/jasminandmatt'>Jasmin & Matt<\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/info\/testimonials\/'>Read our testimonials of appreciation from previous couples<\/a>\u00a0<3<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Rated 5 out of 5 stars on Facebook. <strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/reviews'>Check us out!<\/a><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"forward@jasminandmatt.com","IpAddress":"187.153.21.84","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1464781539,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287055.jpg?_r=1464796174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JasminMattPhoto","Id":287055,"Name":"JasminMattPhoto","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.46.28","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80208,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dc15c7cff4bbb26b1cb458c0f3210721","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the forum community Latashaingram, and Congrats on your DR wedding next June!!! You&#039;re sure to find lots of helpful resources here to answer your planning questions, so well done on getting a good start on your process.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;re based in the Mayan Riviera, so can&#039;t really advise you on the Jellyfish, however here&#039;s a link to some threads talking about it.....&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?s=088fcdc93c2f5e49fcf74be6a2ab10b2&amp;amp;app=googlecse#gsc.tab=0&amp;amp;gsc.q=Jellyfish&#039;&gt;Jellyfish Restaurant threads&lt;\/a&gt; hope that helps :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For some added inspiration, here are a few magical beach wedding moments we captured in Mexico, taken from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/riviera-maya-resorts&#039;&gt;Riviera Maya Wedding Story Albums&lt;\/a&gt;.....enjoy!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_f83fc0a2087f49f287ef9da5704b1405~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_f83fc0a2087f49f287ef9da5704b1405~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_f83fc0a2087f49f287ef9da5704b1405~\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_49b175513da246878994045d97334701~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_49b175513da246878994045d97334701~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_49b175513da246878994045d97334701~\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_dadce00eb9e84a089344330a08f0e2e1~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_dadce00eb9e84a089344330a08f0e2e1~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_dadce00eb9e84a089344330a08f0e2e1~\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans! Enjoy your amazing journey ahead - cheers!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Moments That Matter Photography team :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915041,"PostDate":1469542028,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to the forum community Latashaingram, and Congrats on your DR wedding next June!!! You're sure to find lots of helpful resources here to answer your planning questions, so well done on getting a good start on your process.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We're based in the Mayan Riviera, so can't really advise you on the Jellyfish, however here's a link to some threads talking about it.....<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?s=088fcdc93c2f5e49fcf74be6a2ab10b2&app=googlecse#gsc.tab=0&gsc.q=Jellyfish' class='bbc_url' title=''>Jellyfish Restaurant threads<\/a> hope that helps <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For some added inspiration, here are a few magical beach wedding moments we captured in Mexico, taken from our <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/riviera-maya-resorts' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Riviera Maya Wedding Story Albums<\/a>.....enjoy!!!<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_f83fc0a2087f49f287ef9da5704b1405~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_f83fc0a2087f49f287ef9da5704b1405~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_f83fc0a2087f49f287ef9da5704b1405~\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_49b175513da246878994045d97334701~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_49b175513da246878994045d97334701~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_49b175513da246878994045d97334701~\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_dadce00eb9e84a089344330a08f0e2e1~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_dadce00eb9e84a089344330a08f0e2e1~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_dadce00eb9e84a089344330a08f0e2e1~\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans! Enjoy your amazing journey ahead - cheers!!!<\/p>\n<p>Moments That Matter Photography team <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00